# The runtime is fetched from the fork's GitHub release at build time
# (see Dockerfile: ARG TILESERVER_RELEASE_TAG). The local vendored copies are
# no longer COPYed into the image, so keep them out of the build context to
# avoid shipping ~219 MB of unused files to the Docker daemon on every build.
#
# These are the .gitignore'd generated inputs (binary, shared libs, GDAL/PROJ
# data, CA bundle). `nsswitch.conf` is NOT ignored — it is small and committed.
tileserver-rs
runtime-libs/
gdal-data/
ca-certs/
